[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (right and left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892217\">7045A02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892245\">7050A90</a>\n                                           (right,\ncentre and left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892214\">7040L44</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892184\">7040B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a>\n                                           (right and left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892186\">7040B46</a>\n                                           (six\nrings)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892208\">7040L14</a>\n                                           (six elements)</p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the vent.</p><p>3. Detach the Velcro from the front carpet.</p><p>4. Unscrew the retainers.</p><p>5. Remove the button using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Remove the rear carpet from the floor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035762.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the carpet is undamaged.</p><p>Refit the rear floor carpet.</p><p>Fit the front button.</p><p>Screw on the retainers.</p><p>Join the Velcro to the front carpet.</p><p>Fit the vent.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892208\">7040L14</a>\n                                           (six elements)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892186\">7040B46</a>\n                                           (six\nrings)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a>\n                                           (right and left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892184\">7040B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892214\">7040L44</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892245\">7050A90</a>\n                                           (right,\ncentre and left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892217\">7045A02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p>"]]